e":"祠官负责祭祀事务，此处指派祠官管理渭陽、長門五帝的祭祀，以按时进行礼仪。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"使祠官領","start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"9fcc0e8c-41ee-49c9-b7bb-8d5882ca0f4f"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_death_year":-163,"link_td_description":"新垣平，赵国人，西汉人物，善于望气之术，因假造祥瑞欺骗汉文帝，被灭族。","link_td_id":"Q10013234","link_td_number_id":1577373,"people_name":"新垣平","people_name_jianti_auto":"新垣平","people_xingming":"新垣平","start_index":11,"tongjian_id":"8f081291-db0e-11ef-86d1-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":-163,"link_td_description":"新垣平，赵国人，西汉人物，善于望气之术，因假造祥瑞欺骗汉文帝，被灭族。","link_td_id":"Q10013234","link_td_number_id":1577373,"people_name":"平","people_name_jianti_auto":"平","people_xingming":"新垣平","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"8f081292-db0e-11ef-922a-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"五帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"五帝","people_xingming":"五帝","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8f081293-db0e-11ef-acab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭阳","resolved_place_entity_id":2473,"start_index":48,"tongjian_id":"8f081294-db0e-11ef-a6ca-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長門","place_name_jianti_auto":"长门","resolved_place_entity_id":4126,"start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"8f081295-db0e-11ef-afc9-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["内政"],"content":"1冬，十月，人有上書告新垣平「所言皆詐也」；下吏治，誅夷平。是後，上亦怠於改正、服、鬼神之事，而渭陽、長門五帝，使祠官領，以時致禮，不往焉。","content_fanyi":"冬季，十月，有人上书控告新垣平，说他“所说全都是欺诈”；文帝将此事交付官吏查办，处死新垣平并灭其族。从此以后，文帝对改定历法、服色和敬奉鬼神等事务也懈怠了，渭阳、长门两地的五帝庙，则命祠官负责，按时节祭祀行礼，不再亲自前往。","content_jianti_auto":"1冬，十月，人有上书告新垣平「所言皆诈也」；下吏治，诛夷平。是后，上亦怠于改正、服、鬼神之事，而渭阳、长门五帝，使祠官领，以时致礼，不往焉。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1203,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f08128c-db0e-11ef-a2d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":